<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Score after the second day of a</p>
<p>four-day Sheffield Shield match on Friday:</p>
<p>South Australia 154; New South Wales 342 for five (Michael</p>
<p>Slater 102, Kevin</p>
<p>Roberts 119).</p>
